---
import BaseHead from "../components/BaseHead.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <BaseHead title="Credits" description="Giving thanks and sharing links" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <Header />

    <main>
      <div
        class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center article-header bg-hero p-25 text-black-900"
      >
        <h1>Credits</h1>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-12 gap-4">
        <div class="col-span-2 bg-gradient"></div>
        <div
          class="col-span-10 text-black main-content lar padding-y-xxl"
        >
          <section>
            <p>
              Back in the day, people would add something called humans.txt to
              their websites to give credits. Typical things included were
              contact information and technology used to build the website. I
              like this tradition but opted to make this its own separate
              page.I'll be listing all the typical stuff that I used to build
              this website along with some shout outs.
            </p>
            <h2>Contact Information</h2>
            <p>Author: Susan Silver</p>
            <p>Email: SuzzaStitches@susansilver.net</p>
            <p>Location: Oregon</p>

            <h2 class="flex flex-row items-center justify-center gap-2">
              <span> Built With</span>
              <span>
                <svg
                  xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
                  width="30"
                  height="30"
                  viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                  ><path
                    fill="currentColor"
                    d="m12 21.35l-1.45-1.32C5.4 15.36 2 12.27 2 8.5C2 5.41 4.42 3 7.5 3c1.74 0 3.41.81 4.5 2.08C13.09 3.81 14.76 3 16.5 3C19.58 3 22 5.41 22 8.5c0 3.77-3.4 6.86-8.55 11.53z"
                  ></path></svg
                ></span
              >
            </h2>
            <p><a href="https://astro.build">Astro</a></p>
            <p><a href="https://tailwindcss.com/">Tailwind CSS</a></p>
            <h2>Resources</h2>
            Fonts
            <hr />
            <p>
              <a href="https://uncut.wtf/display/solide/">Solide Mirage</a> by Jérémy
              Landes via Uncut used for website name.
            </p>
            <p>
              <a href="https://uncut.wtf/sans-serif/abordage/">Abordage</a> from
              Degheest by Ange Degheest, Camille Depalle, Eugénie Bidaut, Luna Delabre,
              Mandy Elbé, May Jolivet, Oriane Charvieux, Benjamin Gomez, Justine
              Herbel. Distributed by velvetyne.fr. Used as sans font for the website
              and is found on Uncut.
            </p>
            Astro Integrations
            <hr />

            <p>
              <a href="https://docs.astro.build/en/recipes/rss/">RSS Feed</a>
            </p>
            <p>
              <a
                href="https://docs.astro.build/en/guides/integrations-guide/sitemap/"
                >Sitemap</a
              >
            </p>
            <p>
              <a
                href="https://accessible-astro.incluud.dev/getting-started/introduction/"
                >Accessible Astro</a
              >
            </p>
            <p>
              <a href="https://github.com/surjithctly/astro-navbar"
                >Astro-Navbar</a
              >
            </p>
            <p><a href="https://astro-embed.netlify.app/">Astro Embed</a></p>
            <p><a href="https://github.com/PlayForm/Compress">Compress</a></p>
            <p>
              <a
                href="https://docs.astro.build/en/guides/integrations-guide/mdx/"
                >MDX</a
              >
            </p>
            <p>
              <a href="https://docs.astro.build/en/guides/styling/#tailwind"
                >Tailwind CSS</a
              >
            </p>
            <p>
              <a href="https://docs.astro.build/en/recipes/external-links/"
                >Add icons to external links in Markdown</a
              >
            </p>
            <p>
              <a href="https://docs.astro.build/en/recipes/reading-time/"
                >Add reading time</a
              >
            </p>
            CSS
            <hr />
            <p>
              <a
                href="https://gomakethings.com/how-to-break-an-image-out-of-its-parent-container-with-css/"
                >How to break an image out of its parent container</a
              > by Chris Ferdinandi.
            </p>
            <p>
              <a href="https://heropatterns.com/">Hero Patterns</a> for SVG background.
            </p>
            <p>
              <a href="https://iconify.design/">Iconify</a> for SVG icons.
            </p>
            <!--  JavaScript
            <hr />
            <p>
              <a
                href="https://little-fire.com/make-all-external-links-open-in-a-new-window/"
                >Open external links in a new window</a
              >
            </p> -->
          </section>
        </div>
      </div>
    </main>
    <footer>
      <Footer />
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>
